      "id": "1d9ed4541b78ad2d24ae777f6e17f0d85955238e69ec465203085d09db8feb8e",
      "title": "Kalshi’s Tarek Mansour Wants to ‘Depolarize the Conversation’",
      "url": "https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/227815/superforecasting-by-philip-e-tetlock-and-dan-gardner",
      "category": "uncategorized",
